  "notes": [
   "Catalogue was empty, so all part types are new; element IDs are taken from the manual's callouts. Piece names and port layouts are my best reading of the small illustrations, not verified against the inventory pages, which were not included in the provided pages.",
   "The minifigure is built in a separate box on page 1. The manual does not show it being placed in the cockpit, so I added no edge between it and the helicopter.",
   "Exact stud-level attachments in steps 2-6 are approximate. Stud ports are generalised as 'studs' and 'underside'.",
   "In step 6 only one yellow 3005744 plate is shown in the parts box, so I used one. The final picture may show more yellow pieces.",
   "Positions of 434926 (side piece), 461726 (tail rotor) and 4142731 (main rotor) are inferred from the step 6 picture.",
   "The skids 4259937 are a left/right pair used as two identical parts."
  ]
 },
